 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- `ToolRegistry.register` now compiles static `ToolDefinition.inputSchema` definitions at
+  registration time (throwing an error naming the tool when a schema is not valid JSON Schema),
+  and `ToolRegistry.execute` validates both static and function-valued dynamic tool inputs
